{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lotta is a psychological horror game inspired by the style and atmosphere of &quot;The Conjuring Universe&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average time to complete:<i>\u00a060min</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460860/extras/Lotta_-_Unreal_Editor_2025-06-19_23-09-05.gif?t=1750852353\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Derek Morgan, a 29-year-old watchman who works in a garage complex. A week ago, Derek moved from Portland to Seattle. One night, Derek was bored at work, so he decided to enter the complex's abandoned carpentry shop. Inside, he comes across an old wooden puppet. But soon he realizes that his curiosity has brought nothing good with it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460860?t=1750852353","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460860/5207d28aca7236cf9757247b61d05b08d87c645c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750852353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460860/0c25c8acc5e628b4d12f2055d6b02db4a4cb28b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750852353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460860/0c25c8acc5e628b4d12f2055d6b02db4a4cb28b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750852353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lotta is a psychological horror game inspired by the style and atmosphere of &quot;The Conjuring Universe&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average time to complete:<i>\u00a060min</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460860/extras/Lotta_-_Unreal_Editor_2025-06-19_23-09-05.gif?t=1750852353\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Derek Morgan, a 29-year-old watchman who works in a garage complex. A week ago, Derek moved from Portland to Seattle. One night, Derek was bored at work, so he decided to enter the complex's abandoned carpentry shop. Inside, he comes across an old wooden puppet. But soon he realizes that his curiosity has brought nothing good with it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p>","developers":["Yabuco Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460860/16f07014c4193bfaafe7a9d98c9f710e2a7cb292/header.jpg?t=1750852353","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Lotta","package_groups":[],"